{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The award winning and genre defining video game, <strong>Timothy 3</strong>, is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first Timothy-type game you will face a plural amount of\u00a0<i>headache inducing</i> challenges. Some  will rage-quit and refund the game within minutes, while some will think it's a breeze, complete the game and also refund it within minutes. (Please don't).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u00a0*<strong>points finger</strong>*, yes you. You will recognize a true masterpiece when you see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.poster.avif?t=1757524099\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.webm?t=1757524099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.mp4?t=1757524099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY DESCRIPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a different plane of existence and embody Timothy with only the <i>other</i> voice to guide you. As Timothy, you have 1 minute to complete the task the voice gives you. Frantic running, munching, grabbing, chopping and throwing required. Even jumping is a monumental task for poor Timothy. The game should last for an average playthrough of 30 minutes, while it is possible to complete in the first minute. 100 % achievements may take up to 1,5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.poster.avif?t=1757524099\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.webm?t=1757524099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.mp4?t=1757524099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking stuff up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing said stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood chopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An awesome narrator</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520790?t=1757524099","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520790?t=1757524099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/1a402c77029d8d69cfbfe72d5027182e0e26656e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757524099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/1a402c77029d8d69cfbfe72d5027182e0e26656e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757524099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The award winning and genre defining video game, <strong>Timothy 3</strong>, is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first Timothy-type game you will face a plural amount of\u00a0<i>headache inducing</i> challenges. Some  will rage-quit and refund the game within minutes, while some will think it's a breeze, complete the game and also refund it within minute